  "inline_comments": [
    {
      "body": "![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)\n\nInstead of hardcoding the commit hash, we can allow it to be overridden via the `DEEPEP_COMMIT` environment variable, defaulting to the pinned commit. This improves maintainability and aligns the script's behavior with the `Dockerfile` (which uses `ARG DEEPEP_COMMIT`).\n\n```suggestion\n    git checkout ${DEEPEP_COMMIT:-567632dd59810d77b3cc05553df953cc0f779799} && \\\n```",
